    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he brought me back to the outer gate of the sanctuary, which faces east; and it was shut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the Lord",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, “This gate shall remain shut; it shall not be opened, and no one shall enter by it; for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, has entered by it; therefore it shall remain shut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Only the prince may sit in it to eat bread before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; he shall enter by way of the vestibule of the gate, and shall go out by the same way.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.15.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 15.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Then he brought me by way of the north gate to the front of the temple; and I looked, and behold, the glory of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " filled the temple of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; and I fell upon my face. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, “Son of man, mark well, see with your eyes, and hear with your ears all that I shall tell you concerning all the ordinances of the temple of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and all its laws; and mark well those who may be admitted to",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the entrance of",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the temple and all those who are to be excluded from the sanctuary. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And say to the rebellious house,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb lacks",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "house",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to the house of Israel, Thus says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": O house of Israel, let there be an end to all your abominations, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in admitting foreigners, uncircumcised in heart and flesh, to be in my sanctuary, profaning it,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "it my temple",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " when you offer to me my food, the fat and the blood. You",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Syr Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "they",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " have broken my covenant, in addition to all your abominations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you have not kept charge of my holy things; but you have set foreigners to keep my charge in my sanctuary.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Therefore",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "for you",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " thus says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": No foreigner, uncircumcised in heart and flesh, of all the foreigners who are among the people of Israel, shall enter my sanctuary. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the Levites who went far from me, going astray from me after their idols when Israel went astray, shall bear their punishment. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall be ministers in my sanctuary, having oversight at the gates of the temple, and serving in the temple; they shall slay the burnt offering and the sacrifice for the people, and they shall attend on the people, to serve them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because they ministered to them before their idols and became a stumbling block of iniquity to the house of Israel, therefore I have sworn concerning them, says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", that they shall bear their punishment. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall not come near to me, to serve me as priest, nor come near any of my sacred things and the things that are most sacred; but they shall bear their shame, because of the abominations which they have committed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet I will appoint them to keep charge of the temple, to do all its service and all that is to be done in it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“But the Levitical priests, the sons of Zadok, who kept the charge of my sanctuary when the people of Israel went astray from me, shall come near to me to minister to me; and they shall attend on me to offer me the fat and the blood, says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they shall enter my sanctuary, and they shall approach my table, to minister to me, and they shall keep my charge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they enter the gates of the inner court, they shall wear linen garments; they shall have nothing of wool on them, while they minister at the gates of the inner court, and within. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall have linen turbans upon their heads, and linen breeches upon their loins; they shall not gird themselves with anything that causes sweat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when they go out into the outer court to the people, they shall put off the garments in which they have been ministering, and lay them in the holy chambers; and they shall put on other garments, lest they communicate holiness to the people with their garments. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall not shave their heads or let their locks grow long; they shall only trim the hair of their heads. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No priest shall drink wine, when he enters the inner court. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall not marry a widow, or a divorced woman, but only a virgin of the stock of the house of Israel, or a widow who is the widow of a priest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall teach my people the difference between the holy and the common, and show them how to distinguish between the unclean and the clean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In a controversy they shall act as judges, and they shall judge it according to my judgments. They shall keep my laws and my statutes in all my appointed feasts, and they shall keep my sabbaths holy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall not defile themselves by going near to a dead person; however, for father or mother, for son or daughter, for brother or unmarried sister they may defile themselves. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After he is defiled,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44.26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Syr: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "cleansed",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " he shall count for himself seven days, and then he shall be clean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44.26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Syr: Heb lacks",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "and then he shall be clean",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And on the day that he goes into the holy place, into the inner court, to minister in the holy place, he shall offer his sin offering, says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
